WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:01.440
Hey, Thoughty2 here.

00:00:01.440 --> 00:00:06.720
You’ve heard of snake charming; you may
have even hypnotised a chicken, but I bet

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:09.740
you’ve never heard of worm charming.

00:00:09.740 --> 00:00:14.160
In what may be one of the most British events
in existence, every year the little village

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:18.750
of Willaston in Northern England hosts the
World Worm Charming Championships.

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:24.859
And yes, it is exactly what it sounds like,
charming worms out of the ground.

00:00:24.859 --> 00:00:29.499
From chasing a wheel of cheese down a hill
to racing snails the British really do know

00:00:29.499 --> 00:00:33.320
how to turn any old crap into a competitive
sport.

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:37.910
Every year hundreds of thrill-seekers gather
in the picturesque little village of Willaston

00:00:37.910 --> 00:00:42.100
to compete in an intense championship of global
proportions.

00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:47.020
The World Worm Charming Championships began
in 1980, when some village locals were so

00:00:47.020 --> 00:00:50.920
bored that they decided to challenge each
other to coercing worms out of the ground

00:00:50.920 --> 00:00:52.530
by rapidly tapping on the grass.

00:00:52.530 --> 00:00:57.289
They thought it was so thrilling they made
a competition out of it and it has since grown

00:00:57.289 --> 00:01:02.160
massively in popularity, some people travel
from all over Europe to attend.

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.720
So how does one charm a worm?

00:01:04.720 --> 00:01:10.330
The basic idea is to create vibrations in
the ground which scares the worms to the surface.

00:01:10.330 --> 00:01:14.659
Once they wiggle out of the ground, they must
be picked and placed into a plastic cup, this

00:01:14.659 --> 00:01:19.170
is more difficult than it seems, if they’re
picked too soon or too fast, then it’s easy

00:01:19.170 --> 00:01:21.270
to snap the worm in two.

00:01:21.270 --> 00:01:24.850
Incomplete worms won’t be counted by the
judges.

00:01:24.850 --> 00:01:28.950
Vibrations are created by all kinds of methods,
one of the most popular is jamming a pitchfork

00:01:28.950 --> 00:01:33.670
into the soil and repeatedly hitting it to
send shockwaves into the ground.

00:01:33.670 --> 00:01:38.570
Others opt for more unusual techniques such
as imitating the sound of rain, which worms

00:01:38.570 --> 00:01:43.950
are naturally drawn towards, and even playing
the sound of rainfall into the soil.

00:01:43.950 --> 00:01:49.369
Others simply resort to whacking the ground
with any random object that takes their fancy.

00:01:49.369 --> 00:01:54.740
There was once a woman, who’s genuine technique
was to tap dance to the Star Wars theme song,

00:01:54.740 --> 00:01:58.060
but she wasn’t able to turn them from the
dark side.

00:01:58.060 --> 00:02:02.590
Aside from creating vibrations, moisture is
also a well-used technique.

00:02:02.590 --> 00:02:07.210
Wetting the ground with things such as sugar
water, beer and even urine can help to coerce

00:02:07.210 --> 00:02:09.080
the worms to the surface.

00:02:09.080 --> 00:02:12.360
People create all kinds of strange mixtures
to use during the competition.

00:02:12.360 --> 00:02:18.440
However, there’s a rule, nothing toxic is
allowed to be used and anyone using a liquid

00:02:18.440 --> 00:02:23.110
must first take a gulp of it in front of the
competition’s official judge, the “Worm

00:02:23.110 --> 00:02:25.850
Master”, before using it in the competition.

00:02:25.850 --> 00:02:29.080
Nevertheless, people do still use urine.

00:02:29.080 --> 00:02:34.330
Speaking of rules there are 18 of them in
worm charming, including: “Each competitor

00:02:34.330 --> 00:02:39.440
is given a 3x3 metre plot”, “No digging
or forking is allowed” and “All worms

00:02:39.440 --> 00:02:43.520
must be returned unharmed to the ground after
the competition”.

00:02:43.520 --> 00:02:49.680
Each team is made up of three people: a Charmerer,
a Pickerer and a Counterer, and no I haven’t

00:02:49.680 --> 00:02:53.420
said those wrongly, I’m fairly sure you
can guess what each of their roles are.

00:02:53.420 --> 00:02:59.780
The current world record holder is a 10-year-old
girl, who charmed 567 worms from the ground

00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:03.690
during the World Worm Charming Championships
in 2009.

00:03:03.690 --> 00:03:08.430
But the weird world of worm charming isn’t
just reserved to an eccentric village in the

00:03:08.430 --> 00:03:13.570
North of England, believe it or not there’s
another British village that is totally obsessed

00:03:13.570 --> 00:03:15.570
with worm charming.

00:03:15.570 --> 00:03:20.070
Every year Blackawton, a village stuck to
the bottom of Britain’s big toe, otherwise

00:03:20.070 --> 00:03:23.230
known as Devon, hosts a worm-charming festival.

00:03:23.230 --> 00:03:29.470
The Blackawton International Festival of Wormcharming
is similar to its Northern brother but festivities

00:03:29.470 --> 00:03:34.690
include live music all weekend and unlike
the 3 square metres provided at the World

00:03:34.690 --> 00:03:39.740
Championships, contestants at Blackawton only
get a measly 1 square metre to do their charming.

00:03:39.740 --> 00:03:43.120
Fancy dress is also not an uncommon sight
at the festival.

00:03:43.120 --> 00:03:48.020
The Blackawton festival also has an “Official
Cheat” who’s job is to encourage and even

00:03:48.020 --> 00:03:53.630
help others to cheat, often selling “black
market” worms to contestants, to boost their

00:03:53.630 --> 00:03:54.630
score.

00:03:54.630 --> 00:03:58.970
Despite the fact that the rules state “any
competitor caught cheating will be publically

00:03:58.970 --> 00:04:01.680
humiliated and disqualified”.

00:04:01.680 --> 00:04:06.220
One competitor was banned for life because
he concealed worms up his trouser leg before

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:09.170
the event, so he could sprinkle them onto
the ground.

00:04:09.170 --> 00:04:14.070
You’ve really got to admire someone who
would risk worms sliming up their most personal

00:04:14.070 --> 00:04:22.510
of spaces, just to win a village competition.

00:04:22.510 --> 00:04:41.920
Thanks for watching.

